    <img src="icon:newspaper-fill?size=26&color=ff6b35" style="margin-right: 10px">
    <div class="grow"><div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800">This week in rendering</div><div class="tiny muted">Issue #142 · 6 stories · CSS counters number them, floats place the thumbnails</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="story"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20width=%27200%27%20height=%27200%27%20viewBox=%270%200%20200%20200%27%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3ClinearGradient%20id=%27g%27%20x1=%270%27%20y1=%271%27%20x2=%270%27%20y2=%270%27%3E%3Cstop%20offset=%270%27%20stop-color=%27%230b1d3a%27/%3E%3Cstop%20offset=%270.5%27%20stop-color=%27%2310294d%27/%3E%3Cstop%20offset=%271%27%20stop-color=%27%230d3b4f%27/%3E%3C/linearGradient%3E%3C/defs%3E%3Crect%20width=%27200%27%20height=%27200%27%20fill=%27url%28%23g%29%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M-10%2050C60%200%20140%20110%20210%2070%27%20fill=%27none%27%20stroke=%27%2338d39f%27%20stroke-opacity=%270.55%27%20stroke-width=%2718%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M-10%2078C60%2028%20140%20138%20210%2098%27%20fill=%27none%27%20stroke=%27%235ef2c4%27%20stroke-opacity=%270.43%27%20stroke-width=%2714%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M-10%20106C60%2056%20140%20166%20210%20126%27%20fill=%27none%27%20stroke=%27%2338d39f%27%20stroke-opacity=%270.31%27%20stroke-width=%2710%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M0.8%200a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M53.8%2029a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M106.8%2058a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M159.8%2087a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M12.8%206a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M65.8%2035a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M118.8%2064a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M171.8%2093a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M24.8%2012a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M77.8%2041a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M130.8%2070a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M183.8%2099a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M36.8%2018a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M89.8%2047a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M142.8%2076a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M195.8%20105a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M48.8%2024a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M101.8%2053a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M154.8%2082a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M7.8%201a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M60.8%2030a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M113.8%2059a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M166.8%2088a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M19.8%207a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M72.8%2036a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M125.8%2065a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M178.8%2094a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M31.8%2013a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M84.8%2042a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M137.8%2071a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M190.8%20100a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M43.8%2019a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M96.8%2048a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M149.8%2077a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M2.8%20106a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M55.8%2025a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M108.8%2054a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M161.8%2083a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M14.8%202a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6M67.8%2031a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200%201.6a.8%20.8%200%201%200%200-1.6%27%20fill=%27%23ffffff%27%20fill-opacity=%270.8%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M0%20200V165C70%20140%20130%20185%20200%20160V200Z%27%20fill=%27%23081322%27/%3E%3C/svg%3E" width="76" height="76"><div class="t">Variable fonts land in the system font</div><div class="small muted">Optical sizes and every weight from 100 to 900 are now one file. In this app, <code>font-weight: 650</code> picks the nearest system weight; scroll up in “Stress Test” to see all nine.</div><div class="m muted">Typography · 4 min</div></div>
  <div class="story"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20width=%27200%27%20height=%27200%27%20viewBox=%270%200%20200%20200%27%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3ClinearGradient%20id=%27g%27%20x1=%270%27%20y1=%271%27%20x2=%270%27%20y2=%270%27%3E%3Cstop%20offset=%270%27%20stop-color=%27%2389f7fe%27/%3E%3Cstop%20offset=%270.5%27%20stop-color=%27%2366a6ff%27/%3E%3Cstop%20offset=%271%27%20stop-color=%27%232a5298%27/%3E%3C/linearGradient%3E%3C/defs%3E%3Crect%20width=%27200%27%20height=%27200%27%20fill=%27url%28%23g%29%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M0%2070C10%2062%2030%2078%2040%2070C50%2062%2070%2078%2080%2070C90%2062%20110%2078%20120%2070C130%2062%20150%2078%20160%2070C170%2062%20190%2078%20200%2070M0%2094C10%2086%2030%20102%2040%2094C50%2086%2070%20102%2080%2094C90%2086%20110%20102%20120%2094C130%2086%20150%20102%20160%2094C170%2086%20190%20102%20200%2094M0%20118C10%20110%2030%20126%2040%20118C50%20110%2070%20126%2080%20118C90%20110%20110%20126%20120%20118C130%20110%20150%20126%20160%20118C170%20110%20190%20126%20200%20118M0%20142C10%20134%2030%20150%2040%20142C50%20134%2070%20150%2080%20142C90%20134%20110%20150%20120%20142C130%20134%20150%20150%20160%20142C170%20134%20190%20150%20200%20142M0%20166C10%20158%2030%20174%2040%20166C50%20158%2070%20174%2080%20166C90%20158%20110%20174%20120%20166C130%20158%20150%20174%20160%20166C170%20158%20190%20174%20200%20166M0%20190C10%20182%2030%20198%2040%20190C50%20182%2070%20198%2080%20190C90%20182%20110%20198%20120%20190C130%20182%20150%20198%20160%20190C170%20182%20190%20198%20200%20190%27%20fill=%27none%27%20stroke=%27%23ffffff%27%20stroke-opacity=%270.35%27%20stroke-width=%272%27/%3E%3C/svg%3E" width="76" height="76"><div class="t">Why your chat app does not need a web view</div><div class="small muted">A web view per message costs a process, async height callbacks and a cold start. A layout engine costs a C++ object. We measured both so you don't have to.</div><div class="m muted">Architecture · 7 min</div></div>
  <div class="story"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20width=%27200%27%20height=%27200%27%20viewBox=%270%200%20200%20200%27%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3ClinearGradient%20id=%27g%27%20x1=%270%27%20y1=%271%27%20x2=%270%27%20y2=%270%27%3E%3Cstop%20offset=%270%27%20stop-color=%27%23ffe29f%27/%3E%3Cstop%20offset=%270.5%27%20stop-color=%27%23ffa99f%27/%3E%3Cstop%20offset=%271%27%20stop-color=%27%23ff719a%27/%3E%3C/linearGradient%3E%3C/defs%3E%3Crect%20width=%27200%27%20height=%27200%27%20fill=%27url%28%23g%29%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M0%20200V110C60%2070%20120%20140%20200%20100V200Z%27%20fill=%27%23f6a05c%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M0%20200V140C60%20100%20120%20170%20200%20138V200Z%27%20fill=%27%23e07b39%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M0%20200V170C60%20130%20120%20200%20200%20176V200Z%27%20fill=%27%23b85a26%27/%3E%3C/svg%3E" width="76" height="76"><div class="t">Conic gradients, finally everywhere</div><div class="small muted">Pie charts, donuts, colour wheels and loading spinners from a single CSS property — and a single CoreGraphics call.</div><div class="m muted">Graphics · 3 min</div></div>
  <div class="story"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20width=%27200%27%20height=%27200%27%20viewBox=%270%200%20200%20200%27%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3ClinearGradient%20id=%27g%27%20x1=%270%27%20y1=%271%27%20x2=%270%27%20y2=%270%27%3E%3Cstop%20offset=%270%27%20stop-color=%27%23d4fc79%27/%3E%3Cstop%20offset=%270.5%27%20stop-color=%27%2396e6a1%27/%3E%3Cstop%20offset=%271%27%20stop-color=%27%233a7d44%27/%3E%3C/linearGradient%3E%3C/defs%3E%3Crect%20width=%27200%27%20height=%27200%27%20fill=%27url%28%23g%29%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M-10%20200L10%20130L30%20200Z%27%20fill=%27%232d6a4f%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M16%20200L36%2093L56%20200Z%27%20fill=%27%231e5631%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M42%20200L62%20106L82%20200Z%27%20fill=%27%232d6a4f%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M68%20200L88%20119L108%20200Z%27%20fill=%27%231e5631%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M94%20200L114%2082L134%20200Z%27%20fill=%27%232d6a4f%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M120%20200L140%2095L160%20200Z%27%20fill=%27%231e5631%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M146%20200L166%20108L186%20200Z%27%20fill=%27%232d6a4f%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M172%20200L192%20121L212%20200Z%27%20fill=%27%231e5631%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M198%20200L218%2084L238%20200Z%27%20fill=%27%232d6a4f%27/%3E%3C/svg%3E" width="76" height="76"><div class="t">Gumbo at 10: lessons from an HTML5 parser</div><div class="small muted">The parser that repairs your unclosed tags turns ten. Its authors look back at the spec's adoption agency algorithm and the bugs it hid.</div><div class="m muted">Parsing · 9 min</div></div>
  <div class="story"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20width=%27360%27%20height=%27180%27%20viewBox=%270%200%20360%20180%27%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3ClinearGradient%20id=%27g%27%20x1=%270%27%20y1=%271%27%20x2=%270%27%20y2=%270%27%3E%3Cstop%20offset=%270%27%20stop-color=%27%232b1055%27/%3E%3Cstop%20offset=%270.33%27%20stop-color=%27%237597de%27/%3E%3Cstop%20offset=%270.67%27%20stop-color=%27%23ff9a8b%27/%3E%3Cstop%20offset=%271%27%20stop-color=%27%23ffd194%27/%3E%3C/linearGradient%3E%3C/defs%3E%3Crect%20width=%27360%27%20height=%27180%27%20fill=%27url%28%23g%29%27/%3E%3Ccircle%20cx=%27252%27%20cy=%27110%27%20r=%2732%27%20fill=%27%23fff3c4%27/%3E%3Cpolygon%20points=%270,180%200,130%200,112%2030,110%2060,107%2090,105%20120,102%20150,123%20180,97%20210,118%20240,92%20270,113%20300,110%20330,108%20360,105%20360,180%27%20fill=%27%236a3d7c%27%20fill-opacity=%270.9%27/%3E%3Cpolygon%20points=%270,180%200,150%200,132%2030,130%2060,127%2090,125%20120,122%20150,143%20180,117%20210,138%20240,112%20270,133%20300,130%20330,128%20360,125%20360,180%27%20fill=%27%233f2a5c%27/%3E%3C/svg%3E" width="76" height="76"><div class="t">Dark mode is a stylesheet, not a feature</div><div class="small muted">Swap one user stylesheet, re-render, done. Every bubble here gets <code>lc-dark</code> or <code>lc-light</code> on its body so cards can adapt.</div><div class="m muted">Design · 2 min</div></div>
  <div class="story"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20width=%27360%27%20height=%27150%27%20viewBox=%270%200%20360%20150%27%3E%3Crect%20width=%27360%27%20height=%27150%27%20fill=%27%23f2efe9%27/%3E%3Crect%20x=%2730%27%20y=%2720%27%20width=%2790%27%20height=%2760%27%20rx=%2718%27%20fill=%27%23c8e6c9%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M0%20120C120%2080%20240%20150%20360%20100%27%20fill=%27none%27%20stroke=%27%23aad3df%27%20stroke-width=%2714%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M0%2060L360%2050M200%200L230%20150M90%200L140%20150M0%20140L360%2030%27%20fill=%27none%27%20stroke=%27%23ffffff%27%20stroke-width=%276%27/%3E%3Ccircle%20cx=%27207%27%20cy=%2751%27%20r=%2711%27%20fill=%27%23ff3b30%27/%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M199%2056L207%2072L215%2056Z%27%20fill=%27%23ff3b30%27/%3E%3Ccircle%20cx=%27207%27%20cy=%2751%27%20r=%274%27%20fill=%27%23ffffff%27/%3E%3C/svg%3E" width="76" height="76"><div class="t">The surprising cost of a text width</div><div class="small muted">Layout calls <code>text_width()</code> once per word. Cache it, and re-layout on window resize becomes free. Forget to, and resizing stutters.</div><div class="m muted">Performance · 5 min</div></div>
</div>

